05 - Troubleshooting Guide

Common problems for this design, their cause and the fix.

| # | Symptom | Likely cause | Fix |
|---|---------|--------------|-----|
| 1 | PC gets `169.254.x.x` | DHCP snooping Option 82 inserted while the switch is also the DHCP server | `no ip dhcp snooping information option`, then `ipconfig /renew` |
| 2 | PC gets `169.254.x.x` | Port in wrong VLAN, or DHCP pool excluded range covers the whole pool | `show vlan brief`, `show ip dhcp pool` |
| 3 | `switchport access vlan 999` rejected or warning | VLAN not created yet | Create VLANs before applying port configuration |
| 4 | SSH: `No hostname or domain` / key error | Missing `ip domain-name` or RSA key | Set hostname + domain, run `crypto key generate rsa modulus 2048` |
| 5 | SSH rejected from PC-A | Source not in `MGMT-ACCESS`, or Vlan99 SVI down | `show access-lists MGMT-ACCESS`, `show ip interface brief` |
| 6 | Vlan99 is `down/down` | No active port in VLAN 99 and `no autostate` unsupported on this IOS | Use `no autostate`, or connect a device to Fa0/41-44 |
| 7 | Port is `err-disabled` | Port security, BPDU guard or DHCP rate limit violation | `show interfaces status err-disabled`, fix cause, then `shutdown` / `no shutdown` |
| 8 | Moved PC to another port and it is blocked | Sticky MAC on the old port, or new port has a different sticky MAC | `clear port-security sticky interface fa0/X` and bounce port |
| 9 | Host with static IP cannot communicate | DAI drops ARP because no binding exists | Use DHCP or create an ARP ACL for static hosts |
| 10 | Guest can ping its gateway but nothing else | Expected: `GUEST-IN` blocks internal ranges | Confirm with `show access-lists GUEST-IN` counters |
| 11 | Staff cannot reach guest | Expected: guest replies are dropped by the inbound ACL | By design (see design document, section 8) |
| 12 | Console shows garbage | Wrong baud or flow control | 9600 8N1, flow control None |
| 13 | Locked out after login attempts | `login block-for` quiet period active | Wait 120 s, or use the console |
| 14 | Cannot log in on console after config | `login local` set but no local user | Create user with `username netadmin ... secret ...` first |

 Handy diagnostic commands

```
show interfaces status err-disabled
show ip dhcp conflict
show ip dhcp server statistics
debug ip dhcp server events      ! disable with "undebug all"
show ip arp inspection statistics
show spanning-tree vlan 10
show logging | include PORT_SECURITY|BPDU|DHCP|ARP
```
